-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version], s 55(b): the assessment of a member of a collective kibbutz on income he did not transfer to the kibbutz.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are copied mechanically from line N of
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/income-tax-ordinance-new-version.he.wiki.txt (sha256 b87f2cf4...6b81b6).
--
-- WHAT IT SAYS. (a) The assessment of a collective kibbutz and of all its members is made, notwithstanding the Ordinance, under the sub-chapter. (b)
-- Notwithstanding (a), the assessment of a member on income he did not transfer to the kibbutz is not made under the sub-chapter, and in it the rates and
-- the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment, and the kibbutz's losses, are not counted.
--
-- WHAT THE ENCODING GIVES. How the income is assessed, and three answers a consumer asks for: whether the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment, the rates counted in it, and the kibbutz's
-- losses are LEFT OUT of the member's assessment of the income (TRUE for income he did not transfer, FALSE for income assessed under the sub-chapter). Where the member's income not
-- transferred stands on the scale ("the rates ... counted ... are not counted") is NOT decided here: the text says what is not counted, not what is
-- (NOTES.md, open question Q5).

§ `Section 55 — the member of a collective kibbutz`

-- src:1862 | סעיף 55 – שומת קיבוץ שיתופי וחבריו [תיקון: תשע״ז־9]
-- src:1863 | (א) שומתם של קיבוץ שיתופי ושל כל חבריו תיעשה, על אף האמור בפקודה זו, לפי הוראות סימן זה.
-- src:1864 | (ב) על אף האמור בסעיף קטן (א), שומתו של חבר קיבוץ שיתופי על הכנסה שהוא לא העביר לקיבוץ, לא תיעשה לפי הוראות סימן זה, ובשומה כאמור לא יובאו בחשבון שיעורי המס ונקודות הזיכוי אשר הובאו בחשבון בשומתו של הקיבוץ וכן הפסדיו של הקיבוץ.

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 55(a)-(b) (source lines 1863-1864)
GIVEN `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `How the income of a kibbutz member is assessed`
`s 55 — the member's income is assessed` `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` MEANS
    IF   `the income was transferred to the kibbutz`
    THEN `under the sub-chapter on the kibbutz and its members`
    ELSE `apart from that sub-chapter, the rates and credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment and the kibbutz's losses not being counted`

-- (b): in an assessment of income not transferred, the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment are not counted again. Under (a), they are the kibbutz's.
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 55(b) (source line 1864)
GIVEN `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 55(b) — the credit points counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` MEANS
    NOT `the income was transferred to the kibbutz`

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 55(b) (source line 1864)
GIVEN `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 55(b) — the rates counted in the kibbutz's assessment are left out of the member's assessment of income` `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` MEANS
    NOT `the income was transferred to the kibbutz`

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 55(b) (source line 1864)
GIVEN `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 55(b) — the kibbutz's losses are left out of the member's assessment of income` `the income was transferred to the kibbutz` MEANS
